# Paper tree — nested so it can override the project .gitignore above it.
#
# Local previews only; the published artefact lives on R2.
out.*
.preview.typ

# These ARE tracked. The project .gitignore's `*.json` would otherwise swallow
# the figure data, and a fresh clone could not rebuild the PDF — the figures
# read their own assets/*.json. `.build.json` is tracked because publishing
# happens on the GPU box: without it in git, changed_since_publish() on the Mac
# sees no prior state and reports every file as new.
!assets/*.json
!.build.json
